+<!-- advc.008c: These two BtS hints were too wordy -->
+<TEXT>
+	<Tag>TXT_KEY_HINT_55</Tag>
+	<English>During wartime, the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Blockade[COLOR_REVERT] mission lets your ships sever all naval trade of an enemy city. During peacetime, a blockading Privateer will plunder gold from the city owner's treasury.</English>
